Description: modular IRC server
 UnrealIRCd is an Open Source IRC server, serving thousands of networks
 since 1999, with a strong focus on modularity and security. Its features
 include full IRCv3 support, SSL/TLS, cloaking, JSON-RPC, advanced
 anti-flood and anti-spam systems, GeoIP and remote includes.
 .
 The server doesn't start until /etc/unrealircd/unrealircd.conf exists; see
 /usr/share/doc/unrealircd/README.Debian. Third-party modules and the module
 manager aren't supported by this package.
